    "text": "This program has not been compiled or run on any data set. It is built to always produce valid output first and to score as high as possible second.\n\n**Approach**\n1. **Mount selection.** Arms are placed with a greedy facility-location pass. Each task's value for a mount is its score divided by an estimate of the steps needed: the Manhattan distance from the mount to the task's first point, plus the task's internal path length. The greedy keeps choosing the mount that adds the most value, up to R mounts.\n2. **Exclusive regions.** The grid is split among the chosen mounts by a multi-source BFS that never passes through mount cells. Each arm only ever moves inside its own region, so arms can never collide. This removes all timing interactions between arms, which is what keeps the output valid.\n3. **Task filtering.** A task is a candidate for an arm only if all of its assembly points lie inside that arm's region.\n4. **Per-arm scheduling.** Each arm repeatedly takes the remaining task with the best score per estimated step. Every move to the next assembly point is planned as follows:\n   * The arm retracts back to some cell of its current path, then expands along a shortest route that avoids its own body.\n   * A single BFS from the target, with an early stop, chooses the cheapest combination of retracting and expanding.\n   * If a task cannot be finished within the remaining steps, the arm's state is rolled back and the task is dropped.\n5. **Limits.** A tasks's Manhattan length is a lower bound on its cost, so hopeless tasks are skipped without simulating them. A global cap on BFS work keeps the run time bounded without using a clock, so the output stays deterministic.\n\n**Trade-off:** a task whose points fall in two different regions can never be completed, so some score is given up in exchange for guaranteed validity.\n\n**Edge case:** if no task can be completed at all, the program prints `0`. That is not a valid `A`, but that data set would score zero anyway.\n\n```cpp\n#include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint W,H,R,M,T,L;\nvector<int> mx,my;\nvector<int> TS;\nvector<vector<int>> TP;\nvector<int> regionId, isMountArr, inStack, visArr, distArr, parArr, qbuf;\nint stampv=0;\nlong long workCnt=0;\nconst long long WORK_CAP=700000000LL;\n\nstatic inline int manh(int a,int b){return abs(a%W-b%W)+abs(a/W-b/W);}\n\nstruct Arm{\n    int k; int mount;\n    vector<int> st; vector<char> mv; vector<int> tasks;\n};\n\nchar dirOf(int a,int b){\n    int ax=a%W,ay=a/W,bx=b%W,by=b/W;\n    if(bx==ax+1) return 'R';\n    if(bx==ax-1) return 'L';\n    if(by==ay+1) return 'U';\n    return 'D';\n}\nvoid pushCell(Arm&A,int c){\n    A.mv.push_back(dirOf(A.st.back(),c));\n    A.st.push_back(c); inStack[c]=(int)A.st.size();\n}\nvoid popCell(Arm&A){\n    int c=A.st.back(); A.st.pop_back(); inStack[c]=0;\n    A.mv.push_back(dirOf(c,A.st.back()));\n}\n\nbool moveTo(Arm&A,int target){\n    int limit=L-(int)A.mv.size();\n    int len=A.st.size();\n    if(A.st.back()==target) return true;\n    if(inStack[target]){\n        int j=inStack[target]-1;\n        int r=len-1-j;\n        if(r>limit) return false;\n        for(int i=0;i<r;i++) popCell(A);\n        return true;\n    }\n    if(workCnt>WORK_CAP) return false;\n    stampv++;\n    int qh=0,qt=0;\n    qbuf[qt++]=target; visArr[target]=stampv; distArr[target]=0;\n    int best=INT_MAX,bj=-1,bu=-1;\n    while(qh<qt){\n        int u=qbuf[qh++]; workCnt++;\n        int d=distArr[u];\n        if(best<=d+1) break;\n        if(d+1>limit) break;\n        int ux=u%W,uy=u/W;\n        int nb[4];int nn=0;\n        if(ux+1<W) nb[nn++]=u+1;\n        if(ux>0) nb[nn++]=u-1;\n        if(uy+1<H) nb[nn++]=u+W;\n        if(uy>0) nb[nn++]=u-W;\n        for(int i=0;i<nn;i++){\n            int v=nb[i];\n            if(inStack[v]){\n                int j=inStack[v]-1;\n                int cost=(len-1-j)+d+1;\n                if(cost<best){best=cost;bj=j;bu=u;}\n            } else if(regionId[v]==A.k && !isMountArr[v] && visArr[v]!=stampv){\n                visArr[v]=stampv; distArr[v]=d+1; parArr[v]=u; qbuf[qt++]=v;\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    if(best>limit) return false;\n    int r=len-1-bj;\n    for(int i=0;i<r;i++) popCell(A);\n    int cur=bu; pushCell(A,cur);\n    while(cur!=target){cur=parArr[cur]; pushCell(A,cur);}\n    return true;\n}\n\nint main(){\n    if(scanf(\"%d %d %d %d %d %d\",&W,&H,&R,&M,&T,&L)!=6) return 0;\n    mx.resize(M);my.resize(M);\n    int N=W*H;\n    isMountArr.assign(N,0);\n    for(int i=0;i<M;i++){scanf(\"%d %d\",&mx[i],&my[i]); isMountArr[my[i]*W+mx[i]]=1;}\n    TS.resize(T);TP.resize(T);\n    vector<long long> tlen(T,0);\n    for(int t=0;t<T;t++){\n        int P; scanf(\"%d %d\",&TS[t],&P);\n        TP[t].resize(P);\n        for(int i=0;i<P;i++){int x,y;scanf(\"%d %d\",&x,&y);TP[t][i]=y*W+x;}\n        for(int i=1;i<P;i++) tlen[t]+=manh(TP[t][i-1],TP[t][i]);\n    }\n    // mount selection\n    vector<double> bestT(T,0.0);\n    vector<char> chosenF(M,0);\n    vector<int> chosen;\n    vector<int> mcell(M);\n    for(int i=0;i<M;i++) mcell[i]=my[i]*W+mx[i];\n    for(int r=0;r<R;r++){\n        double bg=0;int bm=-1;\n        for(int m=0;m<M;m++){\n            if(chosenF[m]) continue;\n            double g=0;\n            for(int t=0;t<T;t++){\n                long long c=manh(mcell[m],TP[t][0])+tlen[t];\n                if(c>L) continue;\n                double f=(double)TS[t]/(double)(c+1);\n                if(f>bestT[t]) g+=f-bestT[t];\n            }\n            if(g>bg){bg=g;bm=m;}\n        }\n        if(bm<0) break;\n        chosenF[bm]=1; chosen.push_back(bm);\n        for(int t=0;t<T;t++){\n            long long c=manh(mcell[bm],TP[t][0])+tlen[t];\n            if(c>L) continue;\n            double f=(double)TS[t]/(double)(c+1);\n            if(f>bestT[t]) bestT[t]=f;\n        }\n    }\n    int K=chosen.size();\n    regionId.assign(N,-1);\n    inStack.assign(N,0);visArr.assign(N,0);distArr.assign(N,0);parArr.assign(N,0);qbuf.assign(N+5,0);\n    {\n        int qh=0,qt=0;\n        for(int k=0;k<K;k++){int c=mcell[chosen[k]];regionId[c]=k;qbuf[qt++]=c;}\n        while(qh<qt){\n            int u=qbuf[qh++];int ux=u%W,uy=u/W;\n            int nb[4];int nn=0;\n            if(ux+1<W) nb[nn++]=u+1;\n            if(ux>0) nb[nn++]=u-1;\n            if(uy+1<H) nb[nn++]=u+W;\n            if(uy>0) nb[nn++]=u-W;\n            for(int i=0;i<nn;i++){int v=nb[i]; if(regionId[v]==-1&&!isMountArr[v]){regionId[v]=regionId[u];qbuf[qt++]=v;}}\n        }\n    }\n    vector<vector<int>> rt(K);\n    for(int t=0;t<T;t++){\n        int r=regionId[TP[t][0]]; if(r<0) continue;\n        bool ok=true;\n        for(int p:TP[t]) if(regionId[p]!=r||isMountArr[p]){ok=false;break;}\n        if(ok) rt[r].push_back(t);\n    }\n    vector<Arm> arms;\n    for(int k=0;k<K;k++){\n        Arm A; A.k=k; A.mount=mcell[chosen[k]];\n        A.st.push_back(A.mount); inStack[A.mount]=1;\n        vector<int> cand=rt[k];\n        while(!cand.empty()){\n            int rem=L-(int)A.mv.size();\n            int top=A.st.back();\n            double br=-1;int bi=-1;\n            for(int i=0;i<(int)cand.size();i++){\n                int t=cand[i];\n                long long lb=manh(top,TP[t][0])+tlen[t];\n                if(lb>rem) continue;\n                double ratio=(double)TS[t]/(double)(lb+1);\n                if(ratio>br){br=ratio;bi=i;}\n            }\n            if(bi<0) break;\n            int t=cand[bi];\n            cand[bi]=cand.back();cand.pop_back();\n            vector<int> savedSt=A.st; size_t savedMv=A.mv.size();\n            bool ok=true;\n            for(int p:TP[t]){ if(!moveTo(A,p)){ok=false;break;} }\n            if(ok) A.tasks.push_back(t);\n            else{\n                for(int c:A.st) inStack[c]=0;\n                A.st=savedSt;\n                for(int i=0;i<(int)A.st.size();i++) inStack[A.st[i]]=i+1;\n                A.mv.resize(savedMv);\n            }\n            if(workCnt>WORK_CAP) break;\n        }\n        for(int c:A.st) inStack[c]=0;\n        if(!A.tasks.empty()) arms.push_back(move(A));\n    }\n    string out;\n    out+=to_string(arms.size())+\"\\n\";\n    for(auto&A:arms){\n        out+=to_string(A.mount%W)+\" \"+to_string(A.mount/W)+\" \"+to_string(A.tasks.size())+\" \"+to_string(A.mv.size())+\"\\n\";\n        for(size_t i=0;i<A.tasks.size();i++){if(i)out+=' ';out+=to_string(A.tasks[i]);}\n        out+='\\n';\n        for(size_t i=0;i<A.mv.size();i++){if(i)out+=' ';out+=A.mv[i];}\n        out+='\\n';\n    }\n    fwrite(out.data(),1,out.size(),stdout);\n    return 0;\n}\n```",
